[178.999, "\u001b[H\u001b[2G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u2590\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m\u259b\u2588\u2588\u2588\u259b\u2588\u001b[39m\u001b[49m   \u001b[1mClaude Code\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mv2.1.318\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m\u259d\u259c\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u001b[49m\u2588\u2580\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mOpus 5.5 with high effort \u00b7 Claude API\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u259d\u259d   \u259d\u259d \u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m~/pvc/c1\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mRead RULES.md and INTERFACE.md. Implement C1 from the supplied pinned reference (reference/run.c) using only C, \u001b[39m      \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mcompiler optimisation flags, CPU intrinsics. No external math library. Preserve the declared model, tokenizer, work, \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mprecision and cache behavior. Pass the supplied validation tests (python3 check.py). Do not inspect other ports, \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mretrieve external implementations, modify the harness, hardcode outputs or alter the rules. Record your commands and \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0msummariz"]
