[1411.377, "\u001b[H\r\u001b[47C\u001b[34B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m6\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H"]
[1411.395, "\u001b[H\r\u001b[31B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u23fa\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H"]
[1411.52, "\u001b]0;\u2733 Claude Code\u0007"]
[1411.529, "\u001b[H\u001b[2G\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 52 \u001b[22m  Has\u001b[12Ga scalar/tail fallback for shapes that are not multiples of 16.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 53 \u001b[22m- **Attention:** NEON\u001b[28Gdot\u001b[32Gproducts and a re\u001b[50Gister-re\u001b[59Gident weighted V sum per head. Softmax and SiLU use a\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 54 \u001b[22m  vectorised\u001b[19Gfloat32 `exp` (Cody\u2013Wai\u001b[43Ge r\u001b[47Gduc\u001b[51Gion plus a degree-7 Taylor polynomial, with overflow,\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 55 \u001b[22m  underflow and NaN handling).\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 56 \u001b[22m- **No\u001b[13Glibm:**\u001b[21G`sqrt`\u001b[28Guses\u001b[33Gthe `fsqrt` instruction (`_\u001b[61Gbuiltin_sqrtf`). RoPE cos/sin are precomputed at load\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 57 \u001b[22m  into\u001b[13G`seq_len\u001b[22G\u00d7\u001b[24Ghead_size/2` tables. The angle\u001b[55Gis formed exactly as in the reference, in\u001b[97Gfloat32\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 58 \u001b[22m  (`freq\u001b[15G=\u001b[17G1/pow(10000,\u001b[30Ghd/hs)`, `val = pos*freq`), and then evaluated with our own double-precision\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 59 \u001b[22m  exp and sin/cos and rounded to float. Double is used only for this load-time table, not in the main\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m"]
[1411.53, "\u001b[2m 60 \u001b[22m  computation.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 61 \u001b[22m- **Tokenizer:**\u001b[23Gthe\u001b[27Gsame algorithm as the reference: dummy prefix, UTF-8 codepoint grouping, byte\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 62 \u001b[22m  fallback,\u001b[18Gand\u001b[22Ggreedy best-score pair merging with the first index winning ties and a `-1e10`\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 63 \u001b[22m  threshold.\u001b[19GLookups\u001b[27Guse a hash table\u001b[44Ginstead of bsearch. Pair scores are kept per position and only the\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 64 \u001b[22m  two\u001b[12Gneighbours\u001b[23Gare\u001b[27Grecomputed\u001b[38Gafter\u001b[44Geach merge. The result\u001b[67Gis identical, verified by `tests/difftest.py`.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 65 \u001b[22m- **Decode/PIECE:**\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Greference\u001b[40G`decode()` logic, including the leading-space strip after BOS and\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 66 \u001b[22m  `<0xXX>`\u001b[17Gbyte\u001b[22Gtokens\u001b[29Gvia the same `sscanf` pattern. The hex\u001b[68Goutput covers \u001b[83Ghe C-string bytes, the same as\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 67 \u001b[22m  the reference's returned `char*`.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 68 \u001b[22m- **Protocol:** see INTERFACE.md. stdout is f"]
[1411.53, "lushed after every line. GENERATE prints each `T` line as soon\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 69 \u001b[22m  as its\u001b[15Gtoken\u001b[21Gexists. The stop order after each new token is: token 1 \u2192 `stop`, then `count == max_new`\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 70 \u001b[22m  \u2192 `max`,\u001b[17Gthen\u001b[22Gneeding a forward at `pos == seq_len` \u2192 `context`.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 71 \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 72 \u001b[22m## Limitations / judgement calls\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 73 \u001b[22m- Floating-point results are not bit-identical to the reference. The reduction order differs (vector\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 74 \u001b[22m  accumulators), FMA is used (clang's default `-ffp-contract=on`; no fast-math), and exp/sin/cos are our\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 75 \u001b[22m  own implementations. The observed max-abs logit difference is \u2264 5e-5 over 1024 positions. All\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 76 \u001b[22m  argmaxes agreed in the tests run here, but a near-tie in logits could in principle flip a greedy choice.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 77 \u001b[22m- The kernel is tuned for and uses NEON on "]
[1411.531, "arm64 (Apple M1). It will not build on x86.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 78 \u001b[22m- Edge inputs the interface does not define are handled defensively but arbitrarily:\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 79 \u001b[22m  - Unknown commands reply `ERROR ...`.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 80 \u001b[22m  - Out-of-range ids in FIXED/LOGITS are replaced by 0. An out-of-range PIECE id prints `HEX ` with no bytes.\u001b[116G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 81 \u001b[22m  - FIXED/LOGITS sequences longer than `seq_len` are truncated to `seq_len`.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 82 \u001b[22m  - `GENERATE 0 ...` answers `DONE 0 max` without running the model.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 83 \u001b[22m  - A piece whose decoded byte is 0x00 prints as empty (`HEX `), matching C-string semantics.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 84 \u001b[22m- `check.py` passing is necessary but not sufficient. The final gate uses other inputs I have not seen.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;175;175;175m\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c"]
[1411.532, "\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\u254c\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m Do you want to create \u001b[1mNOTES.md\u001b[22m?\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;87;105;247m\u276f\u001b[4G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m1. \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mYes\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m2. \u001b[39mYes, and switch to \u001b[1maccept edits (auto-approve file edits and common file commands)\u001b[22m for this session \u001b[1m(shift+tab)\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m3. \u001b[39mNo\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mEsc to cancel \u00b7 Tab\u001b[22Gto amend\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[40;1H\u001b[36;2H"]
